                  "detail": "IS-IS LSP: Type=18 (L1 LSP) o 20 (L2 LSP), LSP ID, Sequence Number, Remaining Lifetime, Checksum, TLVs (Area Addresses, IP Internal Reachability, IP External Reachability, IS Neighbors, etc.).",
