          "capinfos /tmp/capture.pcap": "File name:        /tmp/capture.pcapNumber of packets: 1847File size:        2847391 bytesCapture duration: 30.847293 secondsAverage packet rate: 59 packets/secAverage packet size: 1542 bytes",
